184: The statistical analysis plan fixed the primary-model rule before analysis: highest cross-validated AUROC, ties (ฅฤAUROC < 0.005) broken by proximity of the calibration slope to 1, then parsimony. LightGBM and random forest fell inside the tie band, so the tie-break decided the choice.
